          "text": "BUNDLE_START\n{\"path\":\"contact.html\",\"content\":\"<!doctype html>\\n<html lang=\\\"en\\\">\\n<head>\\n  <meta charset=\\\"utf-8\\\">\\n  <meta name=\\\"viewport\\\" content=\\\"width=device-width,initial-scale=1\\\">\\n  <title>Contact — {{BUSINESS_NAME}}</title>\\n  <meta name=\\\"description\\\" content=\\\"Connect with {{COACH_NAME}} — compassionate wellness coaching in {{CITY}}, {{STATE}}. Book a discovery or ask about the VIP Day.\\\">\\n  <style>\\n    :root{--bg:#f7fbfc;--card:#ffffff;--muted:#6b7280;--accent:#0f766e;--accent-2:#134e4a;--glass:rgba(15,118,110,0.06);--radius:12px;--container:1100px}\\n    *{box-sizing:border-box}\\n    body{font-family:Inter, system-ui, -apple-system, \\\"Segoe UI\\\", Roboto, \\\"Helvetica Neue\\\", Arial; margin:0; color:#0f172a; background:linear-gradient(180deg,var(--bg),#ffffff);}\\n    .wrap{max-width:var(--container);margin:36px auto;padding:28px;}\\n    header{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;margin-bottom:22px}\\n    .brand{display:flex;gap:14px;align-items:center}\\n    .logo{width:56px;height:56px;border-radius:10px;background:var(--glass);display:grid;place-items:center}\\n    .logo svg{width:40px;height:40px}\\n    h1{font-size:20px;margin:0}\\n    nav{display:flex;gap:16px}\\n    nav a{color:var(--accent-2);text-decoration:none;font-weight:600}\\n    .grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 420px;gap:24px;align-items:start}\\n    .card{background:var(--card);border-radius:var(--radius);padding:22px;box-shadow:0 6px 20px rgba(15,23,42,0.06)}\\n    .hero-block{display:flex;gap:18px;align-items:flex-start}\\n    .hero-copy h2{margin:0;font-size:26px;color:var(--accent-2)}\\n    .hero-copy p{color:var(--muted);margin-top:8px}\\n    .cta-row{margin-top:14px;display:flex;gap:10px}\\n    .btn{background:var(--accent);color:white;padding:10px 14px;border-radius:10px;border:0;cursor:pointer;font-weight:700}\\n    .btn.ghost{background:transparent;color:var(--accent-2);border:1px solid rgba(19,78,74,0.08)}\\n    form .field{display:flex;flex-direction:column;margin-bottom:12px}\\n    label{font-size:13px;color:var(--muted);margin-bottom:6px}\\n    input[type=text],input[type=email],textarea,select{padding:10px;border-radius:8px;border:1px solid #e6eef0;font-size:15px}\\n    textarea{min-height:120px;resize:vertical}\\n    .meta{display:flex;gap:10px;flex-wrap:wrap;margin-top:6px}\\n    .chip{background:var(--glass);padding:8px 10px;border-radius:999px;font-size:13px;color:var(--accent-2)}\\n    .small{font-size:13px;color:var(--muted)}\\n    .social-proof{display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:12px}\\n    .testimonial{display:flex;gap:12px;align-items:flex-start}\\n    .avatar{width:52px;height:52px;border-radius:10px;background:linear-gradient(180deg,#fff,#f1f9f7);display:grid;place-items:center}\\n    footer{margin-top:26px;text-align:center;color:var(--muted);font-size:13px}\\n    .benefits-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(2,1fr);gap:12px;margin-top:14px}\\n    .benefit{background:var(--glass);padding:12px;border-radius:8px}\\n    details summary{cursor:pointer;padding:10px;border-radius:8px;background:#fbfdfc;border:1px solid #eef6f4}\\n    details p{margin:10px 0 0;color:var(--muted)}\\n    @media (max-width:900px){.grid{grid-template-columns:1fr}.wrap{padding:18px}}\\n  </style>\\n</head>\\n<body>\\n  <div class=\\\"wrap\\\">\\n    <header>\\n      <div class=\\\"brand\\\">\\n        <div class=\\\"logo\\\" aria-hidden>\\n          <!-- Inline unique SVG hero mark -->\\n          <svg viewBox=\\\"0 0 48 48\\\" fill=\\\"none\\\" xmlns=\\\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\\\">\\n            <rect x=\\\"2\\\" y=\\\"2\\\" width=\\\"44\\\" height=\\\"44\\\" rx=\\\"10\\\" fill=\\\"url(#g)\\\"/>\\n            <circle cx=\\\"24\\\" cy=\\\"18\\\" r=\\\"7\\\" fill=\\\"#fff\\\" opacity=\\\"0.98\\\"/>\\n            <path d=\\\"M12 36c4-6 20-6 24 0\\\" stroke=\\\"#064e47\\\" stroke-width=\\\"2.5\\\" stroke-linecap=\\\"round\\\" stroke-linejoin=\\\"round\\\"/>\\n            <defs><linearGradient id=\\\"g\\\" x1=\\\"0\\\" x2=\\\"1\\\" y1=\\\"0\\\" y2=\\\"1\\\"><stop stop-color=\\\"#e6fffb\\\"/><stop offset=\\\"1\\\" stop-color=\\\"#ccfbf1\\\"/></linearGradient></defs>\\n          </svg>\\n        </div>\\n        <div>\\n          <div style=\\\"font-weight:700\\\">{{BUSINESS_NAME}}</div>\\n          <div class=\\\"small\\\">{{TAGLINE}}</div>\\n        </div>\\n      </div>\\n      <nav>\\n        <a href=\\\"/\\\">Home</a>\\n        <a href=\\\"/programs.html\\\">Programs</a>\\n        <a href=\\\"/testimonials.html\\\">Stories</a>\\n        <a href=\\\"/book.html\\\">Book</a>\\n        <a href=\\\"/contact.html\\\">Contact</a>\\n      </nav>\\n    </header>\\n\\n    <main class=\\\"grid\\\">\\n      <section>\\n        <div class=\\\"card hero-block\\\">\\n          <div class=\\\"hero-copy\\\">\\n            <h2>Reach out for a 20‑minute clarity conversation</h2>\\n            <p>Begin with a short call to surface patterns, align next steps, and explore the VIP Day that many clients use to make breakthrough progress in one focused session.</p>\\n            <div class=\\\"cta-row\\\">\\n              <a class=\\\"btn\\\" href=\\\"{{PRIMARY_CTA_URL}}\\\">{{PRIMARY_CTA_LABEL}}</a>\\n              <button class=\\\"btn ghost\\\" onclick=\\\"document.getElementById('contact-form').scrollIntoView({behavior:'smooth'})\\\">Message {{COACH_NAME}}</button>\\n            </div>\\n            <div class=\\\"meta\\\">\\n              <span class=\\\"chip\\\">Location: {{CITY}}, {{STATE}}</span>\\n              <span class=\\\"chip\\\">Credentials: {{CREDENTIALS}}</span>\\n              <span class=\\\"chip\\\">Phone: {{PHONE}}</span>\\n            </div>\\n          </div>\\n          <div style=\\\"margin-left:auto;min-width:160px;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center\\\">\\n            <!-- Inline avatar SVG unique to this template -->\\n            <svg width=\\\"140\\\" height=\\\"140\\\" viewBox=\\\"0 0 140 140\\\" xmlns=\\\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\\\" aria-hidden>\\n              <rect width=\\\"140\\\" height=\\\"140\\\" rx=\\\"18\\\" fill=\\\"#ffffff\\\"/>\\n              <g transform=\\\"translate(20,18)\\\">\\n                <circle cx=\\\"50\\\" cy=\\\"34\\\" r=\\\"22\\\" fill=\\\"#f8faf9\\\" stroke=\\\"#0f766e\\\" stroke-width=\\\"2\\\"/>\\n                <rect x=\\\"8\\\" y=\\\"66\\\" width=\\\"84\\\" height=\\\"34\\\" rx=\\\"8\\\" fill=\\\"#ecfdf5\\\" stroke=\\\"#c7f7ee\\\"/>\\n                <path d=\\\"M6 66s22-10 46-10 46 10 46 10\\\" stroke=\\\"#0f766e\\\" stroke-width=\\\"2\\\" fill=\\\"none\\\" stroke-linecap=\\\"round\\\"/>\\n              </g>\\n            </svg>\\n          </div>\\n        </div>\\n\\n        <div style=\\\"height:18px\\\"></div>\\n\\n        <div class=\\\"card\\\">\\n          <h3 style=\\\"margin:0 0 8px 0\\\">How I support clients</h3>\\n          <p class=\\\"small\\\">A clinic‑modern approach: measurable habits, short rituals, and a repeatable framework clients use to regain energy and clarity without intense overhauls.</p>\\n          <div class=\\\"benefits-grid\\\">\\n            <div class=\\\"benefit\\\"><strong>Clear routines</strong><div class=\\\"small\\\">Daily cues that anchor progress.</div></div>\\n            <div class=\\\"benefit\\\"><strong>Accountability loops</strong><div class=\\\"small\\\">Short checkpoints that keep change sustainable.</div></div>\\n            <div class=\\\"benefit\\\"><strong>Stress tools</strong><div class=\\\"small\\\">Breathing & micro‑practices to reset quickly.</div></div>\\n            <div class=\\\"benefit\\\"><strong>Action plans</strong><div class=\\\"small\\\">Small experiments with measurable outcomes.</div></div>\\n          </div>\\n        </div>\\n\\n        <div style=\\\"height:18px\\\"></div>\\n\\n        <div class=\\\"card social-proof\\\">\\n          <h4 style=\\\"margin:0 0 8px 0\\\">Client notes</h4>\\n          <div class=\\\"testimonial\\\">\\n            <div class=\\\"avatar\\\">\\n              <!-- small avatar icon SVG -->\\n              <svg width=\\\"36\\\" height=\\\"36\\\" viewBox=\\\"0 0 36 36\\\" xmlns=\\\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\\\">\\n                <circle cx=\\\"18\\\" cy=\\\"11\\\" r=\\\"6\\\" fill=\\\"#fff\\\" stroke=\\\"#0f766e\\\" stroke-width=\\\"1.5\\\"/>\\n                <path d=\\\"M6 28c4-5 20-5 24 0\\\" stroke=\\\"#0f766e\\\" stroke-width=\\\"1.2\\\" fill=\\\"none\\\" stroke-linecap=\\\"round\\\"/>\\n              </svg>\\n            </div>\\n            <div>\\n              <div style=\\\"font-weight:700\\\">\\\"I reclaimed mornings and my focus\\\"</div>\\n              <div class=\\\"small\\\">\\\"The VIP Day gave me stepwise tools and the accountability I needed. Results felt immediate and gentle.\\\" — A.K.</div>\\n            </div>\\n          </div>\\n\\n          <div class=\\\"testimonial\\\">\\n            <div class=\\\"avatar\\\">\\n              <svg width=\\\"36\\\" height=\\\"36\\\" viewBox=\\\"0 0 36 36\\\" xmlns=\\\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\\\">\\n                <rect x=\\\"4\\\" y=\\\"4\\\" width=\\\"28\\\" height=\\\"28\\\" rx=\\\"6\\\" fill=\\\"#fff\\\" stroke=\\\"#0f766e\\\" stroke-width=\\\"1.2\\\"/>\\n                <path d=\\\"M8 24c6-6 14-6 20 0\\\" stroke=\\\"#0f766e\\\" stroke-width=\\\"1.2\\\" fill=\\\"none\\\" stroke-linecap=\\\"round\\\"/>\\n              </svg>\\n            </div>\\n            <div>\\n              <div style=\\\"font-weight:700\\\">\\\"Practical, not preachy\\\"</div>\\n              <div class=\\\"small\\\">\\\"Simple habit shifts I actually kept. Supportive, calm coaching.\\\" — J.M.</div>\\n            </div>\\n          </div>\\n        </div>\\n\\n        <div style=\\\"height:18px\\\"></div>\\n\\n        <div class=\\\"card\\\">\\n          <h4 style=\\\"margin:0 0 8px 0\\\">A gentle process to join</h4>\\n          <ol class=\\\"small\\\">\\n            <li>Book a 20‑minute clarity conversation.</li>\\n            <li>Receive a short, personalized plan and optional VIP Day proposal.</li>\\n            <li>Start with two weekly check‑ins, then move to the rhythm that fits you.</li>\\n          </ol>\\n        </div>\\n\\n        <div style=\\\"height:18px\\\"></div>\\n\\n        <div class=\\\"card\\\">\\n          <h4 style=\\\"margin:0 0 8px 0\\\">Frequently asked</h4>\\n          <details>\\n            <summary>How long before I see change?</summary>\\n            <p>Clients often notice small shifts in 2–3 weeks with consistent micro‑practices. The programs are built for incremental progress, not quick fixes.</p>\\n          </details>\\n          <div style=\\\"height:8px\\\"></div>\\n          <details>\\n            <summary>Do you offer virtual sessions?</summary>\\n            <p>Yes — most coaching happens via secure video. In‑person options are available in {{CITY}} on request.</p>\\n          </details>\\n          <div style=\\\"height:8px\\\"></div>\\n          <details>\\n            <summary>What does the VIP Day include?</summary>\\n            <p>A focused full‑day session to build a bespoke plan, practical rituals, and a 30‑day plan you can implement immediately.</p>\\n          </details>\\n        </div>\\n\\n        <div style=\\\"height:18px\\\"></div>\\n\\n        <div class=\\\"card\\\">\\n          <h4 style=\\\"margin:0 0 8px 0\\\">Free guide (lead magnet)</h4>\\n          <p class=\\\"small\\\">Download \\\"The 7 Micro‑Habits Reset\\\" — five short practices to anchor energy and a printable habit tracker.</p>\\n          <form id=\\\"lead-form\\\" onsubmit=\\\"event.preventDefault();alert('Thank you — a link will be sent to the email provided.');\\\">\\n            <div style=\\\"display:flex;gap:8px\\\">\\n              <input aria-label=\\\"Email for guide\\\" type=\\\"email\\\" placeholder=\\\"Your email\\\" required style=\\\"flex:1;border-radius:8px;padding:10px;border:1px solid #e6eef0\\\">\\n              <button class=\\\"btn\\\" type=\\\"submit\\\">Get the guide</button>\\n            </div>\\n          </form>\\n        </div>\\n\\n      </section>\\n\\n      <aside>\\n        <div class=\\\"card\\\" id=\\\"contact-form\\\">\\n          <h3 style=\\\"margin:0 0 8px 0\\\">Send a note</h3>\\n          <p class=\\\"small\\\">Prefer email? Write to <a href=\\\"mailto:{{EMAIL}}\\\">{{EMAIL}}</a> or call <a href=\\\"tel:{{PHONE}}\\\">{{PHONE}}</a>.</p>\\n\\n          <form id=\\\"form\\\" onsubmit=\\\"submitForm(event)\\\">\\n            <div class=\\\"field\\\">\\n              <label for=\\\"name\\\">Your name</label>\\n              <input id=\\\"name\\\" name=\\\"name\\\" type=\\\"text\\\" required>\\n            </div>\\n            <div class=\\\"field\\\">\\n              <label for=\\\"email\\\">Email</label>\\n              <input id=\\\"email\\\" name=\\\"email\\\" type=\\\"email\\\" required>\\n            </div>\\n            <div class=\\\"field\\\">\\n              <label for=\\\"interest\\\">What are you interested in?</label>\\n              <select id=\\\"interest\\\" name=\\\"interest\\\">\\n                <option>Discovery call</option>\\n                <option>VIP Day package</option>\\n                <option>3‑month coaching</option>\\n                <option>Other</option>\\n              </select>\\n            </div>\\n            <div class=\\\"field\\\">\\n              <label for=\\\"message\\\">Message</label>\\n              <textarea id=\\\"message\\\" name=\\\"message\\\" placeholder=\\\"Share a few details or goals\\\"></textarea>\\n            </div>\\n            <div style=\\\"display:flex;gap:8px;align-items:center;margin-bottom:12px\\\">\\n              <input id=\\\"consent\\\" type=\\\"checkbox\\\" required>\\n              <label for=\\\"consent\\\" class=\\\"small\\\">I agree to be contacted by {{BUSINESS_NAME}} about my inquiry.</label>\\n            </div>\\n            <div style=\\\"display:flex;gap:8px\\\">\\n              <button class=\\\"btn\\\" type=\\\"submit\\\">Request a call</button>\\n              <a class=\\\"btn ghost\\\" href=\\\"{{PRIMARY_CTA_URL}}\\\">Book now</a>\\n            </div>\\n            <div id=\\\"success\\\" style=\\\"display:none;margin-top:12px;color:var(--accent-2);font-weight:600\\\">Thanks — I will be in touch within 48 hours.</div>\\n          </form>\\n        </div>\\n\\n        <div style=\\\"height:12px\\\"></div>\\n\\n        <div class=\\\"card\\\">\\n          <h4 style=\\\"margin:0 0 8px 0\\\">Quick details</h4>\\n          <div class=\\\"small\\\">Sessions available weekdays and some weekend slots. Payment options and a condensed VIP Day proposal provided after the clarity conversation.</div>\\n        </div>\\n\\n        <div style=\\\"height:12px\\\"></div>\\n\\n        <div class=\\\"card\\\">\\n          <h4 style=\\\"margin:0 0 8px 0\\\">Why this approach?</h4>\\n          <p class=\\\"small\\\">Short, measurable shifts plus compassionate accountability build confidence and consistency — the two things most missing from lasting wellness change.</p>\\n        </div>\\n\\n      </aside>\\n    </main>\\n\\n    <footer>\\n      <div class=\\\"small\\\">© {{BUSINESS_NAME}} — {{COACH_NAME}}, {{CREDENTIALS}} • <a href=\\\"/privacy.html\\\">Privacy</a></div>\\n    </footer>\\n  </div>\\n\\n  <script>\\n    function submitForm(e){\\n      e.preventDefault();\\n      var f = document.getElementById('form');\\n      // basic client validation\\n      if(!f.checkValidity()){ alert('Please complete required fields.'); return; }\\n      document.getElementById('success').style.display = 'block';\\n      f.reset();\\n    }\\n  </script>\\n</body>\\n</html>\"} \n{\"path\":\"README.md\",\"content\":\"# {{BUSINESS_NAME}} — Contact Page (clinic_modern)\\n\\nThis bundle includes the contact page template and usage notes for the wellness coach site.\\n\\nFiles in this chunk:\\n- contact.html — Fully built clinic_modern contact page with required sections.\\n\\nPlaceholders you must replace (or inject at runtime):\\n- {{BUSINESS_NAME}}\\n- {{TAGLINE}}\\n- {{PHONE}}\\n- {{EMAIL}}\\n- {{PRIMARY_CTA_LABEL}}\\n- {{PRIMARY_CTA_URL}}\\n- {{COACH_NAME}}\\n- {{CREDENTIALS}}\\n- {{CITY}}\\n- {{STATE}}\\n\\nDesign notes:\\n- Layout follows the clinic_modern family: crisp grid, muted palette, clinical calm.\\n- Sections included (visible on this page and intended to ripple across the site): hero, social_proof, benefits, process, faq, lead_magnet, cta.\\n- Voice: gentle_therapist — supportive and pragmatic language focusing on habits and outcomes.\\n- Program model mentioned: VIP Day is referenced as a short, high-impact option.\\n\\nInteraction:\\n- The contact form performs basic client-side validation and shows a success message. Replace with your backend endpoint as needed.\\n- Lead magnet form is a placeholder that triggers an alert for demo purposes.\\n\\nAccessibility & responsiveness:\\n- Uses semantic elements where practical; responsive grid collapses to single column under 900px.\\n\\nIntegration tips:\\n- Swap in your SVG assets if you prefer external files. This template uses inline unique SVGs to avoid external assets.\\n- Ensure server-side sanitization and email handling for the contact form.\\n\\nLicense: internal project template for {{BUSINESS_NAME}}.\\n\"} \nBUNDLE_END"
